# p4score

This is my implementation of a tutorial for making a Python project
and uploading it to GitHub, which can be found at: https://medium.com/@thomas.vidori/eebc78b2a12d.


### Purpose

No purpose at all!

### Installation

Run the command:
`pip install git+https://github.com/TVidori/p4score.git`


### Usage

A quick example displaying how to import and use the package:
````python
import test_project

test_project.get_n(2)
````
